{
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
    "tokenfree": "https://tokenyep.com/",
    "name": "Log UK Apify grant alerts to Notion and send closing-soon Slack notifications",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 18947,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Actor 20A — UK Grant Alerts → Notion Database + Slack ClosingSoon Alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -420,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 1400,
        "content": "## Actor 20A — UK Grant Alerts to Notion Database and Slack Closing-Soon Alert\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow listens for a webhook fired when the UK Grant Alert Engine Apify Actor run completes and immediately responds OK so Apify does not retry. In parallel it fetches the full grant matches dataset from Apify, filters the results down to only newly matched grants, and creates a Notion database page for each new match with funding body, award range, deadline, days to close, and application URL. It then checks whether the grant is flagged as closing soon, and if so formats a Slack alert with the award range and deadline and posts it to the team channel so no deadline is missed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure an Apify webhook on the UK Grant Alert Engine Actor pointing at the Apify Webhook node's URL (path apify-uk-grants-notion).\n- Replace YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN in the Fetch Grant Matches node with your Apify API token.\n- Create a Notion database with columns Name (title), Funding Body (select), Programme (text), Min Award GBP (number), Max Award GBP (number), Deadline (date), Days to Close (number), Closing Soon (select Yes/No), Organisation Type (text), Application URL (url), Matched Keyword (text), Status (select), Date Found (date), then replace YOUR_NOTION_GRANTS_DATABASE_ID in the Create Notion Grant Page node.\n- Set up Notion API credentials and Slack OAuth2 credentials in n8n, and replace YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID in the Slack — Closing Soon Alert node.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the closingSoon threshold upstream in the actor configuration to change how many days out counts as urgent, and extend the property mapping in Create Notion Grant Page if you track additional fields like assigned owner or application status."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Receive Run and Fetch Matches\n\nReceives the Apify webhook, acknowledges it immediately, and pulls the full grant matches dataset."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        700,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Filter and Log to Notion\n\nKeeps only new matches and creates a tracked Notion database page for each one."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1160,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Gate and Alert on Closing Soon\n\nOnly fires a Slack alert when the newly logged grant is closing soon."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Apify Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "uk-grants-notion-webhook",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "apify-uk-grants-notion",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Respond to Apify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [
        460,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "OK"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Fetch Grant Matches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/datasets/{{ $json.body.resource.defaultDatasetId }}/items",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "value": "json"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "200"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Only New Matches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-new",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isNewMatch }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Create Notion Grant Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "title": "={{ $json.title || $json.contractTitle || 'Untitled Grant' }}",
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "create",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_NOTION_GRANTS_DATABASE_ID"
        },
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Funding Body",
              "type": "select",
              "selectValue": "={{ $json.fundingBody || $json.portal || 'Innovate UK' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Programme",
              "type": "rich_text",
              "textValue": "={{ $json.programme || $json.fundingProgramme || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Min Award (£)",
              "type": "number",
              "numberValue": "={{ $json.minAward || $json.valueMin || 0 }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Max Award (£)",
              "type": "number",
              "numberValue": "={{ $json.maxAward || $json.valueMax || 0 }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Deadline",
              "type": "date",
              "dateValue": "={{ $json.submissionDeadline || $json.closingDate || '' }}",
              "includeTime": false
            },
            {
              "key": "Days to Close",
              "type": "number",
              "numberValue": "={{ $json.daysUntilClose || 0 }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Closing Soon",
              "type": "select",
              "selectValue": "={{ $json.closingSoon ? 'Yes' : 'No' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Organisation Type",
              "type": "rich_text",
              "textValue": "={{ $json.eligibleOrganisations || $json.organisationType || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Application URL",
              "type": "url",
              "urlValue": "={{ $json.noticeUrl || $json.applicationUrl || $json.url || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Matched Keyword",
              "type": "rich_text",
              "textValue": "={{ $json.matchedKeyword || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Status",
              "type": "select",
              "selectValue": "New"
            },
            {
              "key": "Date Found",
              "type": "date",
              "dateValue": "={{ $today }}",
              "includeTime": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "notionApi": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "Notion API"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Is Closing Soon",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-closing-soon",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Only New Matches').first().json.closingSoon }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Format Closing Soon Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1340,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const grant = $('Only New Matches').first().json;\n\nconst valueRange = grant.minAward && grant.maxAward\n  ? `£${Number(grant.minAward).toLocaleString('en-GB')} – £${Number(grant.maxAward).toLocaleString('en-GB')}`\n  : grant.minAward ? `From £${Number(grant.minAward).toLocaleString('en-GB')}` : 'Value TBC';\n\nconst message = `🔴 *Grant Closing Soon — Act This Week*\\n\\n*${grant.title || grant.contractTitle || 'Grant Competition'}*\\n\\n🏛️ *Funding Body:* ${grant.fundingBody || grant.portal || 'Innovate UK'}\\n💰 *Award Range:* ${valueRange}\\n📅 *Deadline:* ${grant.submissionDeadline || grant.closingDate || 'TBC'} (${grant.daysUntilClose || '?'} days)\\n🔑 *Matched:* ${grant.matchedKeyword || 'Keyword match'}\\n\\n<${grant.noticeUrl || grant.applicationUrl || grant.url || '#'}|Apply / View Full Details>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { message } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "20a00001-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Slack — Closing Soon Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        1560,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID"
        },
        "otherOptions": {},
        "authentication": "oAuth2"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "Slack OAuth2"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "actor20a-v1",
